own an entire Great House. Sidereals were involved in trying to stop this happening. Their collapse is one of the major events of the era.<br /> <br /> I actually don't like the Bull much at all, because he exalts as a solar 5 minutes before you and breaks an entire great house and it feels like it distracts a little from the significance of you doing so as a solar yourself. But it's important, in the end, because it sets a very clear example of what a group of returning solars means for Creation. It means the status quo is about to be given the people's elbow (perhaps People's Elbow Prana) in a way that those 400 lunars just couldnt manage for the last 1500 years.</div> </div> </div> </div>The reason house tepet lost that fight was because every other great house sabotaged them because they wanted tipet to suffer massive losses. It's in the dragon blooded book. Yeah, the bull did win but he had the massive advantage of the realm underhandedly destroying their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T18:53:21-08:00","id":1291369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>bboat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1291019-why-are-lunars-allowed-to-combine-native-charms-and-martial-arts-again?p=1291365#post1291365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Do you have a source for this absolutely interesting figure?<br /> <br /> For your other statement: Why would Lunars give a crap about some fair folk holdouts when their sole MO in 3e is taking down the Realm. Is this even worth discussing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the fairfolk were ravishing creation at the same time as the contagion, they wouldn't have had time to fight the dragon blooded because they were losing their own territory and the lives of their people.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-23T18:54:42-08:00","id":1291370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1291019-why-are-lunars-allowed-to-combine-native-charms-and-martial-arts-again?p=1291369#post1291369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because the fairfolk were ravishing creation at the same time as the contagion, they wouldn't have had time to fight the dragon blooded because they were losing their own territory and the lives of their people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ravaging. Unless you're making a tasteless rape analogy, in which case, carry on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://for